@startuml
title 执行并提交备份顺序图
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam BorderColor #64748B
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #64748B
actor "用户 / 操作系统调度器" as Trigger
control "后台守护进程" as Daemon
control "备份协调器" as Backup
control "扫描与筛选" as Scanner
entity "源文件端口" as Source
control "分块 / 压缩 / 加密 / 打包" as Pipeline
entity "备份仓库" as Repo
control "快照服务" as Snapshot
database "元数据存储" as Meta
Trigger -> Daemon : 触发任务
Daemon -> Meta : 检查互斥并创建运行记录
Daemon -> Backup : execute(task, runId)
Backup -> Scanner : 扫描并应用已编译规则
Scanner -> Source : 遍历源文件
loop 每个匹配文件
Source -> Scanner : 元数据与流式内容
alt 文件可读取
Scanner -> Backup : 候选文件流
loop 每个新数据块
Backup -> Pipeline : 分块 → 压缩 → 可选加密 → 打包
Pipeline -> Repo : 写入临时 pack / 复用已有块
Repo --> Pipeline : 块位置与校验信息
Pipeline --> Backup : ChunkReference
end
else 单文件读取失败
Scanner -> Meta : 记录脱敏错误与策略结果
end
opt 收到取消请求
Daemon -> Backup : cancel(runId)
Backup -> Repo : 停止新增写入并清理未提交对象
Backup -> Meta : 记录已取消
end
end
alt 未取消且全部必需内容已写入
Backup -> Snapshot : 构建清单和 pack 索引
Snapshot -> Repo : 提交对象、清单和提交标记
Repo --> Snapshot : 提交可读取
Snapshot -> Meta : 事务发布快照与成功运行
Meta --> Daemon : 成功状态与统计
else 仓库写入或提交失败
Backup -> Repo : 保留可恢复上传状态或清理临时对象
Backup -> Meta : 记录失败；不发布快照
end
@enduml
